NAME
     managedeventsd – Device Management Endpoint Security client daemon

SYNOPSIS
     managedeventsd

DESCRIPTION
     managedeventsd monitors disk mount events and process execution events
     via Endpoint Security API. It responds to mount and process launch
     requests based on restriction policies from the Device Management system.

FILES
     /System/Library/LaunchDaemons/com.apple.devicemanagementclient.managedeventsd.plist

DIAGNOSTICS
     Logging can be viewed via: log stream --predicate
     'process="managedeventsd"'


